    "Mixel Remote e-mails the invitation link. Administrators and technicians count against the technicians of your plan.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mixel Remote sendet den Einladungslink per E-Mail. Administratoren und Techniker zählen zu den Technikern Ihres Plans."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mixel Remote envoie le lien d’invitation par e-mail. Les administrateurs et techniciens comptent parmi les techniciens de votre forfait."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mixel Remote invia il link d’invito per e-mail. Amministratori e tecnici contano tra i tecnici del Suo piano."
          }
        }
