    "Mixel Remote reconnects by itself. Device status appears once it is connected; you can still choose Connect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mixel Remote verbindet sich selbst wieder. Der Gerätestatus erscheint, sobald die Verbindung steht; Verbinden ist trotzdem möglich."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mixel Remote se reconnecte tout seul. L’état des appareils s’affiche une fois connecté ; vous pouvez quand même choisir Connecter."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mixel Remote si riconnette da solo. Lo stato dei dispositivi appare quando è connesso; può comunque scegliere Connetti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mixel Remote updates itself in the background and restarts between sessions only.": {
      "localizations": {
